      "updated": 1777430579608,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "it will push email to kafka with \nmail_inserted topic\nand follows same flow for delivery\n\nlike validations and then sends \nto internal user using \ninbound_send_request",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "it will push email to kafka with \nmail_inserted topic\nand follows same flow for delivery\n\nlike validations and then sends \nto internal user using \ninbound_send_request",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yuiLw8OP686jXtzZygkqs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7901.040879055194,
      "y": 44463.21287626929,
      "width": 373.40777587890625,
      "height": 665,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bELIV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1807684471,
      "version": 203,
      "versionNonce": 1081922260,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777430579608,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User DB\n\nSQL \n\nemail_id uniqueness required\nand also structural data\n\n{\n  \"userId\": \"u123\",\n  \"emailId\": \"abc@gmail.com\",\n  \"name\": \"Aman\",\n  \"passwordHash\": \"...\",\n  \"createdAt\": 1720748150,\n  \"status\": \"ACTIVE\"\n}\n\n\nPK: userId\nUniqueID: emailId",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "User DB\n\nSQL \n\nemail_id uniqueness required\nand also structural data\n\n{\n  \"userId\": \"u123\",\n  \"emailId\": \"abc@gmail.com\",\n  \"name\": \"Aman\",\n  \"passwordHash\": \"...\",\n  \"createdAt\": 1720748150,\n  \"status\": \"ACTIVE\"\n}\n\n\nPK: userId\nUniqueID: emailId",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "F4sQqe235Ih0IdqQot5jO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8370.079762960615,
      "y": 44463.21287612552,
      "width": 427.979736328125,
      "height": 735,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bELId",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2015485623,
      "version": 105,
      "versionNonce": 814576748,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777430579608,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Draft DB\n\nNoSQL\n\nsimple access by user_id/draft_id, \nhigh scale\nunstructure data of emails\n\n{\n  \"draftId\": \"d123\",\n  \"userId\": \"u123\",\n  \"to\": [\"x@gmail.com\"],\n  \"cc\": [],\n  \"bcc\": [],\n  \"subject\": \"Hello\",\n  \"body\": \"Hi...\",\n  \"attachmentIds\": [\"a1\", \"a2\"],\n  \"updatedAt\": 1720748150\n}\n\nPK: userId",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Draft DB\n\nNoSQL\n\nsimple access by user_id/draft_id, \nhigh scale\nunstructure data of emails\n\n{\n  \"draftId\": \"d123\",\n  \"userId\": \"u123\",\n  \"to\": [\"x@gmail.com\"],\n  \"cc\": [],\n  \"bcc\": [],\n  \"subject\": \"Hello\",\n  \"body\": \"Hi...\",\n  \"attachmentIds\": [\"a1\", \"a2\"],\n  \"updatedAt\": 1720748150\n}\n\nPK: userId",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "OuZEbZwAFKY9E4cVAWCqA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8893.690606860833,
      "y": 44463.21287626082,
      "width": 447.7757263183594,
      "height": 770,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bELIl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1353857175,
      "version": 71,
      "versionNonce": 8607828,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777430579608,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mailbox DB\n\nNoSQL \n\nhuge scale, read by user_id + folder\n\n{\n  \"mailboxItemId\": \"mb123\",\n  \"userId\": \"u123\",\n  \"messageId\": \"m123\",\n  \"threadId\": \"t123\",\n  \"folder\": \"INBOX\",\n  \"from\": \"a@gmail.com\",\n  \"to\": [\"u123@gmail.com\"],\n  \"subject\": \"Hello\",\n  \"snippet\": \"Hi...\",\n  \"attachmentIds\": [\"a1\"],\n  \"status\": \"UNREAD\",\n  \"createdAt\": 1720748150\n}\n\nPK: userId",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Mailbox DB\n\nNoSQL \n\nhuge scale, read by user_id + folder\n\n{\n  \"mailboxItemId\": \"mb123\",\n  \"userId\": \"u123\",\n  \"messageId\": \"m123\",\n  \"threadId\": \"t123\",\n  \"folder\": \"INBOX\",\n  \"from\": \"a@gmail.com\",\n  \"to\": [\"u123@gmail.com\"],\n  \"subject\": \"Hello\",\n  \"snippet\": \"Hi...\",\n  \"attachmentIds\": [\"a1\"],\n  \"status\": \"UNREAD\",\n  \"createdAt\": 1720748150\n}\n\nPK: userId",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
