      "text": "Attachment DB\n\nNoSQL \n\nsimple key-value lookup by attachment_id\n\n{\n  \"attachmentId\": \"a1\",\n  \"ownerUserId\": \"u123\",\n  \"s3Url\": \"s3://bucket/file\",\n  \"fileName\": \"resume.pdf\",\n  \"mimeType\": \"application/pdf\",\n  \"size\": 204800,\n  \"scanStatus\": \"SAFE\",\n  \"createdAt\": 1720748150\n}\n\nPK: attachmentId",
