      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vmFLiokhFY7GStonrv4r5",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 11737.180874461243,
      "y": 38890.12338204385,
      "width": 5030,
      "height": 5165.000000000001,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#bbb",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "FY3ry2VajvMsq-pboBP6e"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bELy8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 375151127,
      "version": 282,
      "versionNonce": 150318188,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777430584518,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "name": "Architectural Design for Email service like GMAIL"
    },
    {
      "id": "OK_lQx-N_tdX4zf5djIeK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1428.7944921374115,
      "y": 41692.47603387366,
      "width": 1298.591552734375,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bELzl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 5348052,
      "version": 151,
      "versionNonce": 1414573548,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777418742629,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n    - User should be allowed to create account in our application\n    - Users can upload (resumed/disconnected) and download files of various size\n    - Changes sync across all devices automatically\n    - User should be able to share files/folders with other users (with permission)\n    - User should be able to - Create, delete, rename folders and organize files\n    - Quota / storage limit: per user quotas",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n    - User should be allowed to create account in our application\n    - Users can upload (resumed/disconnected) and download files of various size\n    - Changes sync across all devices automatically\n    - User should be able to share files/folders with other users (with permission)\n    - User should be able to - Create, delete, rename folders and organize files\n    - Quota / storage limit: per user quotas",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6pQhWjlfgPLhO3Q8Mmf-h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3044.3631597976364,
      "y": 44404.69531028912,
      "width": 808.5069247187126,
      "height": 540,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bELzp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 99730796,
      "version": 627,
      "versionNonce": 1489663700,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777418742629,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n    - User should be allowed to create account in\nour application\n    - Users can upload (resumed/disconnected)\nand download files of various size\n    - Changes sync across all devices\nautomatically\n    - User should be able to share files/folders\nwith other users (with permission)\n    - User should be able to - Create, delete,\nrename folders and organize files\n    - Quota / storage limit: per user quotas",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n    - User should be allowed to create account in our application\n    - Users can upload (resumed/disconnected) and download files of various size\n    - Changes sync across all devices automatically\n    - User should be able to share files/folders with other users (with permission)\n    - User should be able to - Create, delete, rename folders and organize files\n    - Quota / storage limit: per user quotas",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "P_WxLGm6t3qq9Nu5s-yeO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2878.60262174919,
      "y": 41692.47603366345,
      "width": 1219.8758019247214,
      "height": 540,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bELzt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1184350804,
      "version": 638,
      "versionNonce": 1213993068,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777418742629,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non Functional Requirements\n    - Scale: Millions of users/ Billions of files\n    - CAP Theorem: availability >> Consistency\n      (Eventual consistency for sync, strong consistency for metadata)\n    - System should support large files.\n    - Latency to upload should be minimal\n    - Secure and durable (No data loss)\n\n    High availability: upload/download/sync APIs should be highly available\n    Fault tolerance\n    Rate limiting\n    Observability",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non Functional Requirements\n    - Scale: Millions of users/ Billions of files\n    - CAP Theorem: availability >> Consistency\n      (Eventual consistency for sync, strong consistency for metadata)\n    - System should support large files.\n    - Latency to upload should be minimal\n    - Secure and durable (No data loss)\n\n    High availability: upload/download/sync APIs should be highly available\n    Fault tolerance\n    Rate limiting\n    Observability",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
