      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1412088020,
      "version": 267,
      "versionNonce": 925311724,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777422643926,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 2: Chunker Service in local chunk the file based on chunkSize, and generate the SHA256 of each chunks = [0 .. 9]\n\nStep 3: Client asks for signed URL for chunk N (by File Uploader Svc & it checks for upload permission)\n\nPOST /upload/chunk-url\n{\n    uploadId: \"upload123\"\n    chunkId: 3,\n    chunkHash: \"xyz123\"\n}\n\nStep 4: Upload the chunks (parallely 3 at a time)\n\nStep 5: Commit request: POST /uploads/{uploadId}/commit.\n\nStep 6: The FileUploader service calls the MetadataSvc to save all the informations and put the change event into kafka,\nso that sync service can consume it to notify all.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 2: Chunker Service in local chunk the file based on chunkSize, and generate the SHA256 of each chunks = [0 .. 9]\n\nStep 3: Client asks for signed URL for chunk N (by File Uploader Svc & it checks for upload permission)\n\nPOST /upload/chunk-url\n{\n    uploadId: \"upload123\"\n    chunkId: 3,\n    chunkHash: \"xyz123\"\n}\n\nStep 4: Upload the chunks (parallely 3 at a time)\n\nStep 5: Commit request: POST /uploads/{uploadId}/commit.\n\nStep 6: The FileUploader service calls the MetadataSvc to save all the informations and put the change event into kafka, so that sync service can consume it to notify all.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
