      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bNG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 574155220,
      "version": 497,
      "versionNonce": 1419361492,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777430672252,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "note: chunking (with example)\n\nexample:\n\noriginal file = abcdefgh\nfixed chunk size = 2 → [ab] [cd] [ef] [gh]\n\nnow insert d → abdcdefgh\n\nnew chunks → [ab] [dc] [de] [fg] [h...]\n\n👉 all chunks after change are shifted → hashes change →\nalmost full file re-upload\n\nBUT BUT BUT\n\nin real systems, we use content-defined chunking (not fixed\nsize). it is also called as rolling hash like Rabin fingerprint\n\nchunks are based on content, not position.\n\nso after change, only nearby chunk changes, rest remain\nsame.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "note: chunking (with example)\n\nexample:\n\noriginal file = abcdefgh\nfixed chunk size = 2 → [ab] [cd] [ef] [gh]\n\nnow insert d → abdcdefgh\n\nnew chunks → [ab] [dc] [de] [fg] [h...]\n\n👉 all chunks after change are shifted → hashes change → almost full file re-upload\n\nBUT BUT BUT\n\nin real systems, we use content-defined chunking (not fixed size). it is also called as rolling hash like Rabin fingerprint\n\nchunks are based on content, not position.\n\nso after change, only nearby chunk changes, rest remain same.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
